WEBVTT

00:14:26.695 --> 00:14:32.743
we see evidence of individuals
singled out for special grand burials,

00:14:32.743 --> 00:14:36.038
their bodies suffused with ornamentation,

00:14:36.038 --> 00:14:38.999
weapons and even
what looked like regalia.

00:14:38.999 --> 00:14:44.713
We see public buildings constructed
on the bones and tusks of woolly mammoth.

00:14:45.547 --> 00:14:48.425
And around 11,000 years ago,

00:14:48.425 --> 00:14:51.261
back in the Middle East, where I started,

00:14:51.303 --> 00:14:56.350
hunter-gatherers constructed
enormous stone temples

00:14:56.350 --> 00:15:00.687
at a place called Göbekli Tepe
in eastern Turkey.